Package: wb-tsgo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: wb-rules
Description: TypeScript compiler (Microsoft typescript-go)
 tsgo is Microsoft's native Go implementation of the TypeScript
 compiler, a tsc-compatible command-line tool
 (github.com/microsoft/typescript-go), installed unmodified as
 /usr/bin/tsgo under its upstream binary name.
 .
 wb-rules depends on it to transpile and type-check TypeScript rule
 files; it is also a standalone tool usable for any TypeScript work on
 the controller.
